Hi, my name it's Alice Bopp

6
00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.890 line:15%
I am from Rio de Janeiro, Brazil,

7
00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:18.610
and I am the owner of Muni's Coffee Joint

8
00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:19.860
in Lindenhurst, New York.

9
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.450
I have always loved coffee.

10
00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.540
And I love communicating with people.

11
00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:27.010
With all the situation with the pandemic.

12
00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:28.300
We wanted to do something.

13
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.880
So I got an note board.

14
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:31.280
That's how we started.

15
00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:32.740
So you come to the coffee shop,

16
00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:33.750
