17
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.100
you add it to your bill another coffee,

18
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.030
paying a coffee forward to somebody else

19
00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:39.020
that you don't know.

20
00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:40.849
And you add the post-it on the board,

21
00:00:40.849 --> 00:00:42.950
and another person who comes later on,

22
00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:43.970
is gonna grab that post-it

23
00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:46.040
is gonna use for their own drink.

24
00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:48.360
With a beautiful note from you.

25
00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.500
And from there,

26
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.930
we have been from 400,

27
00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:52.890
maybe 500 post-its already.

28
00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:55.590
And we had letters from people from different states.

29
00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:57.390
I have people sending me money.

30
00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.520
That board is showing how much you care

31
00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:02.140
and how much you wanna bright up somebody else's life.

32
00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:05.840
It's pretty much love, love, love all the way around.

33
00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:07.870
I think it's gonna be forever there.

34
00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:08.969
Cheering people's lives.

35
